  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.51 Touch-up coating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.51 \"Touch-up coating\" means a coating used to cover minor coating imperfections that appear after the main coating operation is completed.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
